    "description": {
      "content": "Externally-reconstructed Postman collection for the Evisort REST API (now Workday Contract Lifecycle Management, powered by Evisort). Authenticate by POSTing your Evisort API key to /v1/auth/token to obtain a JWT, then set it as the bearer token. The full reference is behind Evisort's authenticated developer portal.\n\nContact: https://developers.evisort.com/",
